# Create your tests here.

# The trained model file is gitignored and not committed (it's a large
# binary artifact, regenerated by the training pipeline) -- a fresh clone or
# a CI environment that hasn't staged it separately won't have it on disk.
# Tests that need a real loaded model skip cleanly instead of erroring with
# an unhelpful FileNotFoundError that looks like a real regression.
